WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:04.560
Cookie Clicker is a game about clicking a
cookie.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.760
It’s simple at first, but gets increasingly
complex.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:14.549
The late game meta has elaborate strategies
to maximise cookie production, to unlock all

00:00:14.549 --> 00:00:20.290
the upgrades and achievements, and to uncover
the deep lore of the grandmapocalypse, the

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:25.020
krumblor dragon, and the mysteries of the
cookie universe.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:29.260
In the beginning, you click the cookie – which
gets you one cookie.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.180
You click again, you’ve got two.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.180
Then three.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:38.760
With fifteen cookies, you can buy a cursor
that clicks for you, making cookies automatically.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:44.059
Ten cursors make one cookie per second, or
one CpS.

00:00:44.059 --> 00:00:48.969
So you make more cookies, to buy more cursors,
to make more cookies – then for a hundred

00:00:48.969 --> 00:00:51.739
cookies, you buy your first grandma.

00:00:51.739 --> 00:00:57.199
This kindly old woman performs unpaid labour
to grow your cookie business – your cookies

00:00:57.199 --> 00:01:03.090
become popular in the neighbourhood , then
renowned all over town . Production accelerates

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.330
exponentially.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:09.850
You buy cookie farms to grow cookies, mines
to extract cookies from the earth, factories

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:13.250
to produce cookies on an industrial scale.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:19.180
The cookie economy transforms the world around
it – chocolate pollutes the rivers , there’s

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:25.070
an obesity epidemic . But the world is too
hooked on cookies to stop – economists say

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:30.101
that “"cookies permeate the economy", and
"If we start eating anything else, we're all

00:01:30.101 --> 00:01:36.859
dead" ”. Cookie banks start using cookies
as currency . At temples, thousands pray to

00:01:36.859 --> 00:01:44.859
the Baker in the sky . There is no value,
no ideology, and no meaning beyond cookies.

00:01:44.859 --> 00:01:49.969
You produce hundreds of thousands of cookies
a second, straining the fabric of reality

00:01:49.969 --> 00:01:56.250
itself . You build wizard towers and alchemy
labs to summon cookies magically, you fly

00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:00.749
in shipments from space of cookies from alien
worlds.

00:02:00.749 --> 00:02:06.590
You open portals to a parallel dimension,
taking in millions of cookies per second.

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:12.900
Alien beings and cosmic elder gods come to
taste your cookies , and whole cities are

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:19.190
engulfed in transdimensional disaster , but
the system can’t stop, it can only grow,

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:21.090
cookies are all we know.

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:28.900
A local “confused idiot” says “you gotta
admit, all this cookie stuff is a bit ominous”

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:34.030
. Time machines bring cookies from the past,
corrupting history with abominations of dough

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:40.090
. You make cookies from antimatter, from light,
from pure chance, you make cookies from other

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:45.810
cookies, and cookies from beyond the fourth
wall, you make trillions of cookies a second.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:51.900
The foundations of the cosmos crack under
the mass of the cookie economy.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:57.100
Everything is transformed, either into cookies
or into the means to create cookies – “The

00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:03.250
universe [becomes] cookie dough, [down] to
the molecular level” , an infinite “sentient”

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:10.920
terrifying cookie gestalt . The only escape
from the cosmic cookie machine is death – – yet

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.720
not even that can save you.

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:19.360
When you’re ready, you ascend – you leave
the mortal world for a higher plane of cookie

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.900
existence, where you can buy special Heavenly
Upgrades.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:28.819
Then you are reborn in a new game, with zero
cookies, to start it all again.

00:03:28.819 --> 00:03:32.890
But you keep certain upgrades and bonuses,
so you can quickly reach and surpass where

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.640
you were before.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:41.480
Birth, death and rebirth are an endless inescapable
cycle of cookie samsara.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:43.800
And the mechanics get more complex.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.879
Cookie Clicker is an idle game.

00:03:45.879 --> 00:03:49.590
You’re not meant to sit there clicking the
cookie – you’re meant to leave it on in

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:53.689
the background while it makes cookies for
you, and occasionally come back to spend cookies

00:03:53.689 --> 00:03:54.980
on upgrades.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:58.930
In the early game, this passive playstyle
is efficient.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:03.510
Upgrades like the Golden Lock and the Shimmering
Veil optimise for idle cps.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:08.020
But in the late game, the best way to progress
is with an active playstyle.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:13.780
Cause every five minutes or so, a Golden Cookie
spawns – if you click it in time, you get

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:18.840
a random temporary bonus like a Cookie Frenzy,
which increases your cookie production by

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:21.000
seven times for one minute.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:26.139
The best effect is the Building Special, which
temporarily multiplies your rate of production

00:04:26.139 --> 00:04:30.240
based on how many buildings you have – so
if you have hundreds of buildings, that can

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.949
multiply your cps by thousands of times over.

00:04:33.949 --> 00:04:40.110
And if you can stack multiple multipliers
together, you can increase production by millions

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:41.800
of times over.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:48.139
You can spawn more Golden Cookies with the
Grimoire – the minigame unlocked at the

00:04:48.139 --> 00:04:49.139
Wizard Tower.

00:04:49.139 --> 00:04:54.050
One of the Grimoire spells, called Force The
Hand of Fate summons a Golden Cookie.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:59.270
So by manipulating the Mana pool by strategically
selling Towers, and by spending Sugar Lumps

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:04.970
to replenish Mana, you can cast the Hand of
Fate spell several times in a row, reliably

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:08.270
generating three or four golden cookies at
once.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:12.000
If you’re lucky, and those cookies grant
multiple Building Specials, you can generate

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:17.580
CpS multipliers of millions of times regular
production, making weeks worth of cookies

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.580
in minutes.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:24.650
To make the most of these bonuses, you need
certain plants from the Cookie Garden.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:29.780
The Garden grows cookie seeds into cookie
plants, which can mutate along a complex cookie

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:35.860
evolutionary trees to unlock new seeds with
new effects – like thumbcorn buffs clicking,

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:41.449
and cheapcap reduces prices, but the good
shit is bakeberries.

00:05:41.449 --> 00:05:45.940
When harvested bakeberries, give you 30 minutes
worth of cookie production instantly.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:50.920
So, if you harvest them while you’ve got
a huge CpS multiplier from Golden Cookies,

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:54.520
you can make months worth of cookies instantly.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:58.139
You can fill the garden with bakeberries,
freeze them at maturity, and keep spawning

00:05:58.139 --> 00:06:02.539
Golden Cookies til you get a huge multiplier,
then harvest all the bakeberries at once,

00:06:02.539 --> 00:06:04.259
for massive profit.

00:06:04.259 --> 00:06:08.830
Alternatively, you can go for the Click Frenzy
Golden Cookie effect, which synergises with

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.139
the Godzamok Pantheon idol.

00:06:11.139 --> 00:06:15.440
Once you’ve got Krumblor the Cookie Dragon,
you can do some pretty wild shit with the

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:20.680
Dragon’s Fortune and Dragonflight Auras,
though for passive play the Breath of Milk

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:24.139
aura is usually ideal for the buff to kittens.

00:06:24.139 --> 00:06:29.169
Of course, the seasonal events like Christmas
are also essential, so you can upgrade Santa

00:06:29.169 --> 00:06:34.990
from an elf fetus to a Bulky elf to Elder
Santa and then to Final Claus, who grants

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:39.419
dominion of his realm, and a cheeky 20% cps
bonus.

00:06:39.419 --> 00:06:46.420
So the late game involves a variety of strategies
to min-max for optimal cookie production.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.900
But the cookies are not without cost.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:53.600
As production increases, the grandmas grow
discontent.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.770
“You make me sick” grandma says.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:00.480
“You could have stopped it”, grandma says.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:06.830
After the Bingo Center upgrade, and the One
Mind tech tree, the Grandmapocalypse begins.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:07.940
[Nanageddon music].

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:13.310
The indentured labour force at the bottom
of the pyramid rebels, a hive mind of mutant

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:20.470
grandmas rise , and transform the globe into
an eldritch horror-scape of cookie-based monstrosity.

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:26.289
Wrinkled "flesh tendrils" are visible from
space , writhing masses of dough engulf whole

00:07:26.289 --> 00:07:30.980
cities , spreading like an infectious virus.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:37.009
The only way to end the Grandmapocalypse is
with an Elder Covenant – you can sacrifice

00:07:37.009 --> 00:07:40.750
some economic gain to save everyone.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:46.320
But it can actually be more efficient to continue
the disaster, and send everyone back to work

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.569
anyway.

00:07:47.569 --> 00:07:51.030
Because the Grandmapocalypse spawns Wrinklers.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:57.400
Wrinklers leech 5% of CpS, but when you pop
them, they give back more than they took.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:08:03.970
So you can increase economic production by
risking the lives of the elderly.

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:09.490
Disaster is actually an opportunity to exploit
the vulnerable to make more wealth.

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:15.130
Ultimately, the cookie economy is not designed
to help people, it just makes cookies – like

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:21.120
a virus or a tumour, its nature is to exploit
everything around it for its own expansion.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:28.770
Grandmas, banks, temples, every part of life
is perverted to serve the purpose of ‘the

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:29.770
economy’.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:34.140
Nothing is too sacred to be sacrificed on
its altar.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:35.140
And for what?

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:40.390
What's the point of a massive global economy
if it fails to protect the elderly and the

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:41.580
vulnerable?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:46.450
Even those with the most cookies don’t really
benefit from the system – past a certain

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:50.330
level of wealth, you can never spend that
many cookies.

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.450
And it’s not like the game ever ends.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.680
You cannot win.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:58.370
You just keep making cookies until you stop
or you die.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:01.890
You’re just hoarding cookies for its own
sake.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:07.660
It’s not really about the cookies – it’s
about accumulation, getting more.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:12.660
You could be collecting any meaningless number
– points, subscribers, small green pieces

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:16.810
of paper – past a certain point, you’re
just making a number go up.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:22.280
It’s not even a real number, cause look,
behind the scenes, you can cheat, you can

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:26.990
literally type in a number and print two trillion
cookies out of thin air [cookie printer goes

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:29.630
brrr], their value is imaginary.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:35.230
And yet the lives and health of our grandmas
are being risked to increase this imaginary

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.230
number.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:42.530
The problem is that a system designed to make
cookies is not designed to make wellbeing,

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.290
justice and happiness.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:49.750
Any system of endless growth, of singular
purpose, that warps the whole world around

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:54.700
one goal – can only grow until it self-destructs.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:10:01.090
The only way we can escape such a game…
is to stop playing.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:04.570
Thanks for watching this video about Cookie
Clicker.

